{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This single-player Japanese Mahjong game offers flexible battle modes, allowing you to freely choose between intense 2-player showdowns, strategic 3-player matches, or lively 4-player games. The game strictly uses a standard 136-tile deck, including numerical tiles (Man, Pin, Sou), and honor tiles (East, South, West, North, Red Dragon, Green Dragon, White Dragon).<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762280/extras/5.png?t=1749698994\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Staying true to classic Japanese Mahjong rules, it requires a minimum of 1 han (fan) to declare a win, featuring over 50 yaku (winning patterns) such as <i>Riichi</i> (declaring a ready hand while concealed), <i>Pinfu</i> (a simple hand with no honor tiles), and <i>Chinisu</i> (all tiles of one suit). <i>Riichi</i> must be declared in a closed hand (no melds), adding challenge and excitement; <i>Pinfu</i> requires a hand of sequences and a pair with no honor tiles; <i>Chinisu</i> focuses on a single suit, offering diverse strategies for winning.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762280/extras/8.png?t=1749698994\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additionally, the game includes an automatic scoring system that accurately calculates points based on han and fu (value units), simulating real-world matches. Enjoy the strategic depth and fun of Japanese Mahjong anytime, anywhere\u2014no internet needed\u2014perfect for solo play.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762280/extras/6.png?t=1749698994\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are still three cheating skills that will make your dream of becoming a mahjong master come true~<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762280/extras/2.png?t=1749698994\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3762280?t=1749698994","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3762280?t=1749698994","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762280/8a1809741e28b77b6907fb09126d1347b3605baa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749698994","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762280/8a1809741e28b77b6907fb09126d1347b3605baa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749698994","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Some characters in the game are dressed sexy, but there is no adult content"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This single-player Japanese Mahjong game offers flexible battle modes, allowing you to freely choose between intense 2-player showdowns, strategic 3-player matches, or lively 4-player games. The game strictly uses a standard 136-tile deck, including numerical tiles (Man, Pin, Sou), and honor tiles (East, South, West, North, Red Dragon, Green Dragon, White Dragon).<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762280/extras/5.png?t=1749698994\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Staying true to classic Japanese Mahjong rules, it requires a minimum of 1 han (fan) to declare a win, featuring over 50 yaku (winning patterns) such as <i>Riichi</i> (declaring a ready hand while concealed), <i>Pinfu</i> (a simple hand with no honor tiles), and <i>Chinisu</i> (all tiles of one suit). <i>Riichi</i> must be declared in a closed hand (no melds), adding challenge and excitement; <i>Pinfu</i> requires a hand of sequences and a pair with no honor tiles; <i>Chinisu</i> focuses on a single suit, offering diverse strategies for winning.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762280/extras/8.png?t=1749698994\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additionally, the game includes an automatic scoring system that accurately calculates points based on han and fu (value units), simulating real-world matches. Enjoy the strategic depth and fun of Japanese Mahjong anytime, anywhere\u2014no internet needed\u2014perfect for solo play.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762280/extras/6.png?t=1749698994\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are still three cheating skills that will make your dream of becoming a mahjong master come true~<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762280/extras/2.png?t=1749698994\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["TMG"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762280/97623105bffdafd9f3b15baaee692712bf98bebc/header.jpg?t=1749698994","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},